  "limitations": [
    "Targets are weather-derived challenge proxies. No historical airport direction or RWY18 closure log was available; scores do not measure actual operations accuracy.",
    "METAR gust absence is replaced with reported sustained wind; this may miss gust-related restrictions. VRB/missing wind directions are excluded.",
